  "idea": "How to extract text from a screenshot or image without retyping it",
  "text": "Copy any text on your screen directly to your clipboard instantly. Whenever website security disables right-click copy or embeds quotes inside graphics, your progress stalls. Typing out complex terms or lengthy links by hand guarantees frustrating formatting mistakes. Take a screenshot using native Windows Text Actions or Mac Live Text to grab unselectable words. It copies flawless paragraphs straight to your clipboard in under two seconds.",
